config VIDEO_SOPHGO_SENSOR
	bool "Sophgo Sensor Devices"
	help
	  If you have sensor device designed by Sophgo, say Y.

	  Note that this option doesn't include new drivers in the kernel:
	  saying N will just cause Kconfig to skip all the questions about
	  Sophgo sensor devices.

config SENSOR_V4L2_IMX585
	depends on I2C && VIDEO_DEV
	tristate "imx585 support"
	default n
	help
	  Support for Sensor on the CV186X SoC.

